$------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ DY unary functions - REPLACED with Unary5.0 (NIMS, matching Dinsdale/SGTE
$ reference state). This is a real fix, not cosmetic: Rong et al. (2017,
$ Fe-Dy) and Li et al. (2020, Dy-B) both fit their compound/liquid
$ parameters against this Unary5.0 GHSERDY. The old Konar-lineage GHSERDY
$ previously here was a DIFFERENT reference state, causing a mismatch that
$ was confirmed to make the liquid artificially over-stable at low T when
$ combined with the new Dy-B data.
